# The kernel boots on QEMU, reports what the loader handed over, the
# syscall MSRs, XCR0 and the XSAVE area size (M5), the interrupt
# controllers, the HPET and the timer it calibrated, the CPU state it set
# up (CR4 with OSXSAVE and EFER with SCE from M5), and the BootInfo
# summary of boot steps 6 to 9 (the boot region, the untyped, the
# framebuffer's untyped and the slot regions) with the root task they
# built from .rootimage, which is then unmapped (M5), and says hello. The
# CI-built VHDX runs the same command line on Hyper-V.
cmdline: test=hello
exit: success
expect: loader: microL4 loader
expect: entering kernel
expect: microL4 kernel
expect: cpu: features NX PGE PAT SMEP SMAP XSAVE
expect: memory:
expect: cpu: hypervisor QEMU
expect: cmdline: "test=hello"
expect: entry: syscall_entry at 0xffffffff8 # its address moves with the image
expect: , IA32_STAR 0x13000800000000, IA32_FMASK 0x257fd5, EFER.SCE on, IA32_SYSENTER_CS 0
expect: fpu: XCR0 0x3 of
expect: supported, XSAVE area 576 bytes of the TCB's 1024
expect: hyperv: no TLFS interface: highest leaf 0x40000001, below 0x40000005
expect: apic: IA32_APIC_BASE 0xfee00900 at handover: xAPIC
expect: apic: xAPIC ID 0, version 0x50014, 6 LVT entries, all masked; TPR 0, SVR 0x1ff, LVT error 0xfe
expect: apic: ESR 0x0 (no error)
expect: pic: remapped to 0x20 and 0x28, every line masked: masks 0xff 0xff
expect: ioapic: 0: ID 0, version 0x20, 24 pins for GSI 0-23, all masked
expect: ioapic: COM1's GSI 4 is I/O APIC 0 pin 4
expect: hpet: period 10000000 fs, 3 comparators, 64-bit counter
expect: hpet: legacy replacement and comparator interrupts off, main counter on: 100000000 Hz
expect: timer: calibrating against the HPET at 100000000 Hz
expect: timer: LAPIC timer
expect: timer: periodic at 100 Hz: divide by 1, vector 0xfd
expect: cpu: physical address width 40 bits
expect: cpu: CR0 0x80010033 CR4 0x340ee8 EFER 0xd01
expect: cpu: IA32_APIC_BASE
expect: cpu: meltdown:
expect: bootinfo: boot region 0xf # its size and place move with the root image's
expect: KiB: root CNode at
expect: , IPC buffer at
expect: , BootInfo at
expect: bootinfo:  # the untyped count, which moves with the loader's allocations
expect: untyped:
expect: KiB of RAM,
expect: MiB of device memory, below 2^40
expect: bootinfo: framebuffer 0x80000000-0x803e8000: 6 device untyped, listed first
expect: bootinfo: slots 16-16: extra_bootinfo_frames, 1 slot
expect: bootinfo: slots 17-19: user_image_paging, 3 slots
expect: bootinfo: slots 20- # the image frames, as many as the root image's pages
expect: : user_image_frames,
expect: : untyped,
expect: : framebuffer_untyped, 6 slots
expect: bootinfo: slots
expect: -4095: empty,
expect: boot: root task: image 0x400000-
expect: , entry 0x400000; TCB at
expect: , PML4 at
expect: , 1 PDPT, 1 PD, 1 PT,
expect: image frames
expect: boot: .rootimage
expect: unmapped from the kernel window and reclaimed as RAM untyped
expect: hello from microL4
expect: TEST PASS
